0","0ahUKEwiIm_fbzNKWAxXamq8BHS1KJkUQ3YcHCHQoAA"]],1],null,null,"平均每人消費金額",null,"0ahUKEwiIm_fbzNKWAxXamq8BHS1KJkUQ3IcHCHMoDQ",null,null,null,null,null,1,[[2]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["拜疫情復燃之賜有比較少人，不然以前經過沒一次不客滿。庶民小吃，味道也可以，只是畢竟是路邊攤，少不了機車廢氣加料，能不能接受就看自己會不會在意了。\n\n🟡有CP值，份量不小氣，不到$200吃飽飽，小鳥胃一碗拉麵可能就會叫不敢。\n🟡蕃茄拉麵姑且不論料，湯頭部份就有濃郁度及酸度；料少量多樣，組合起來就是澎湃豐盛。麵非彈牙，但有口感，初始幾口感覺麵芯未熟，而後漸入佳境。\n🟡豬排有拍薄，吃得出香料味，肉軟嫩非常，皮有酥有刺。這道可能評價兩極，肉軟嫩對牙口不佳者極友善，但太軟吃起來心裡會“驚驚”，雖吃得出是鮮肉，但肉感不見不會是好吃的樣子。",null,[0,111]]]],[null,1658079814000000,1658079814000000,"4 年前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfQUFWSWpCMEdSM1prY2NObUFBSHZwZw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfQUFWSWpCMEdSM1prY2NObUFBSHZwZxoTQ2d3SXhwVFJsZ1lRLU9uSXhBRQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiIm_fbzNKWAxXamq8BHS1KJkUQ_2MIdSgO"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7107099248998741143/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlBjamRFTlRSM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7107099248998741143/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlBjamRFTlRSM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7107099248998741143/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlBjamRFTlRSM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7107099248998741143/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlBjamRFTlRSM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7107099248998741143/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlBjamRFTlRSM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7107099248998741143/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlBjamRFTlRSM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["您好，謝謝您的回饋，我們會再接再厲。",null,[0,18]]]],[null,null,16016,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURPcjdENTR3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x42a4c8b6004a4e42!3m1!1s2@1:CI